---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Uniquefacturing | UFAC"
  description="Uniquefacturing (UFAC) — freelance product development from hardware to software. Vision-based inventory recognition and wireless lighting control solutions."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <img class="hero-mark" src="/images/LOGO.png" alt="" width="320" height="320" />
      <p class="eyebrow">Uniquefacturing</p>
      <h1>From hardware to software,<br />a partner who ships the whole product</h1>
      <p class="lead">UFAC is a freelance development contractor with a track record of hardware and solution development across a wide range of products.</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn">Start a project</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>About</h2>
      <p>Uniquefacturing (UFAC) turns ideas into working products. One engineer takes responsibility end to end, from circuit design and firmware to the software solution that runs on top of it.</p>
      <p>Having delivered product development projects across several industries, UFAC now concentrates on solutions built on computer vision and wireless communication.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="focus" class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Focus areas</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</div>
          <h3>Vision-based inventory recognition</h3>
          <p>Solutions that analyze camera footage to recognize stock levels automatically, with recognition models and operating systems tailored to the site environment.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</div>
          <h3>Wireless lighting control</h3>
          <p>Solutions that control large numbers of lights reliably over wireless links, developed as an integrated stack from control hardware to management software.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◆</div>
          <h3>Hardware and solution development</h3>
          <p>Project-based engineering covering technical review at the planning stage, circuit and firmware development, production support, and application software.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For project inquiries or technical consultation, please reach out by email.</p>
      <p class="contact-email"><a href="mailto:uni@ufac.dev">uni@ufac.dev</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
